@node spectral-compressor Plugin Developer Guide
@section Developer Guide

Spectral compressor — per-bin frequency domain dynamics processing.

@subsubheading What It Does

Applies dynamic range compression independently to each frequency bin in the STFT domain. Unlike a multiband compressor (2-5 bands), a spectral compressor operates on hundreds of individual frequency bins, enabling extremely transparent dynamics control. Particularly effective for taming harsh resonances without affecting surrounding frequencies.

@subsubheading Features

@itemize @bullet
@item @strong{Per-bin compression}: Independent dynamics for each frequency bin
@item @strong{STFT-based}: Operates in the frequency domain via Short-Time Fourier Transform
@item @strong{Transparent dynamics}: Far more granular than multiband compression
@item @strong{Spectral taming}: Reduces resonances without coloring surrounding frequencies
@end itemize


